          \.

.ui.container#content
  :asciidoc
    == Changes between Jakarta Validation 3.1 and Jakarta Bean Validation 3.0

    - The minimum required Java version is set to 17.
    - The rename of the specification from Jakarta Bean Validation to Jakarta Validation.
    - The clarification on the record validation.

    == Feedback

    Do you have feedback? Talk to us:

    - on our https://accounts.eclipse.org/mailing-list/bean-validation-dev[mailing list]
    - in the https://github.com/jakartaee/validation/issues[API issue tracker] for API related issues
    - in the https://github.com/jakartaee/validation-spec/issues[Specification issue tracker] for specification related issues
    - in the https://github.com/jakartaee/validation-tck/issues[TCK issue tracker] for TCK related issues

    If you want to take the next step and contribute, read link:/contribute[how to contribute].
